<title>USA: National Vision July same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>National Vision July same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, Ga. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$13.7	$12.4     +10.0	 +6.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $102.5	$93.1     +10.0	 +6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended  July 26.</p>
<p>Full company name is National Vision Associates Inc</p>
<p>Same-store figures are U.S. vision centers only.</p>
